& [Situation]
  + the published private-beta workflow proves exact disposable build-to-rollback mechanics but explicitly lacks a portable distribution artifact and package identity

& [Justification]
  + the smallest dependency-ready product gain is deterministic package identity over the exact four proven binaries
  + production trust configuration migration upgrade delivery support and OS installation each need separate authority and evidence

& [Solution]
  + create one fixed-metadata ZIP with four binaries an exact manifest and bounded README plus an independent nonextracting verifier checked report determinism proof and adversarial refusals

& [Delineation]
  + archive construction is a repository artifact effect; installation extraction execution and service lifecycle are absent
  + SHA256 identity is reproducibility evidence not publisher authenticity or production signing
  + checked local publication is not a supported distribution channel or compatibility promise

& [Decision]
  + activate additive generator verifier adversarial tests checked ZIP evidence runbook and governed closure only
